                  "value": "<string>",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "(Required) The desired name for the file as it will be stored and identified in Convert (e.g., \"campaign_brief.pdf\", \"logo_variation.svg\"). Include the file extension."
                },
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "description": "(Required) The actual binary file content to be uploaded.\nConstraints:\n- Maximum file size: 5MB.\n- Supported types: PDF, DOC, DOCX, XLS, XLSX, PPT, PPTX, TXT, CSV, JPG, JPEG, BMP, GIF, PNG, WEBP, SVG.\n"
                }
              ]
